 providers to conduct certifiable training for employees in industries such as Renewable Energy, Maritime, and Healthcare.\nOur platform offers scalable digital simulators and replaces outdated learning facilities and classrooms with immersive training. Thereby reducing costs, travel time, and CO2 emissions.\nKanda is easily accessible, highly affordable, and available on a simple subscription model.", "short_description": "Using Spatial Computing to make certificate training in Renewable Energy collaborative, engaging, and cost-effective."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.kanda.dk/legal", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://www.kanda.dk/legal", "publisher_name": "Kanda ApS", "support_website_url": "https://www.kanda.dk/knowledge", "website_url": "https://kanda.dk/", "category": "APPS", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1063584910766706"}, {"id": "1043107547362485"}, {"id": "478089301798119"}], "external_subscription_type": "REQUIRED_FOR_SOME_CONTENT", "genres": ["EDUCATIONAL", "SIMULATION"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER", "CO_OP"], "id": "28292321460366506"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982483_1724512001665999_8308388021367359956_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=hLyzbTMHqI4Q7kNvwFX_iJ5&_nc_oc=Adnhvh_u7ohTMhYoZ-ZZHvefcLA04EvHQhn1-O3Q14oZTqbdSbd3EckIWKxbvfXZM64&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afwv760oO6KlKIYhO